@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
top to bottom direction
hide empty members
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 80
skinparam ranksep 65
title Neo4j catalog - supplied schema capture and source-defined Certificate
class JobPosition {
  id: String [UNIQUE]
  code: String
  name: String
  organizationId: String
  version: String
  status: String
  reviewStatus: String
  jobZone: Long
  interestRealistic: Double
  interestInvestigative: Double
  interestArtistic: Double
  interestSocial: Double
  interestEnterprising: Double
  interestConventional: Double
}
class TargetRole {
  id: String [UNIQUE]
  code: String
  name: String
  organizationId: String
  version: String
  status: String
  reviewStatus: String
  scope: String
  assignedExpertId: String
  assignedExpertName: String
}
class Level {
  id: String [UNIQUE]
  code: String
  name: String
  organizationId: String
  version: String
  status: String
  reviewStatus: String
  rank: Long
  attainmentRule: String
}
class Competency {
  id: String [UNIQUE]
  code: String
  name: String
  description: String
  organizationId: String
  version: String
  status: String
  reviewStatus: String
  attainmentRule: String
}
class MicroSkill {
  id: String [UNIQUE]
  name: String
  definition: String
  organizationId: String
  version: String
  status: String
  reviewStatus: String
  reviewSource: String
  reviewedBy: String
  provisionMode: String
  foundationOutcomeCodes: String[]
  foundationOutcomeLabels: String[]
  intermediateOutcomeCodes: String[]
  intermediateOutcomeLabels: String[]
  advancedOutcomeCodes: String[]
  advancedOutcomeLabels: String[]
}
class LearningModule {
  id: String [UNIQUE]
  title: String
  organizationId: String
  version: String
  status: String
  reviewStatus: String
  reviewSource: String
  moduleType: String
  duration: Long
  knowledgeLevel: String
  skillVersion: String
  contentType: String
  contentUri: String
  contentVersion: String
  outcomeCodes: String[]
}
class Certificate <<source only>> {
  id: String [UNIQUE]
  organizationId: String
  version: String
  name: String
  description: String
  knowledgeLevel: String
  skillVersion: String
  outcomeCodes: String[]
  referenceUrl: String
  status: String
  reviewStatus: String
  authoredBy: String
  authoredAt: String
  approvedBy: String
  approvedAt: String
  commandHash: String
}
JobPosition --> TargetRole : HAS_ROLE
TargetRole --> Level : HAS_LEVEL
Level --> Competency : HAS_COMPETENCY
Competency --> MicroSkill : HAS_SKILL
Level --> MicroSkill : REQUIRES_SKILL
LearningModule --> MicroSkill : TEACHES
MicroSkill --> MicroSkill : HAS_SKILL_PREREQUISITE
MicroSkill --> Certificate : REQUIRES_CERTIFICATE
note bottom of MicroSkill
  Catalog only. PostgreSQL owns learner state and evidence.
  Certificate / REQUIRES_CERTIFICATE: source-defined;
  not observed in the supplied Neo4j schema capture.
end note
legend bottom
  Relationship properties (String timestamps remain source-written ISO text)
  |= Relationship |= Properties |
  | HAS_ROLE / HAS_LEVEL / HAS_COMPETENCY / HAS_SKILL | id: String; version: String; status: String; reviewStatus: String |
  | REQUIRES_SKILL | id: String; requiredKnowledgeLevels: String[]; isMandatory: Boolean\nversion: String; status: String; reviewStatus: String |
  | TEACHES | id: String; organizationId: String; version: String\nstatus: String; reviewStatus: String; reviewSource: String |
  | HAS_SKILL_PREREQUISITE | id: String; organizationId: String; prerequisiteKnowledgeLevel: String\ndependentKnowledgeLevel: String; version: String; status: String\nreviewStatus: String; reviewSource: String |
  | REQUIRES_CERTIFICATE (source only) | organizationId: String; status: String; createdBy: String\ncreatedAt: String; replacedBy: String; replacedByActor: String\nreplacedAt: String |
  REQUIRES_CERTIFICATE replacement fields are written only when an assignment is replaced.
  [UNIQUE] = source-defined node id constraint; deployment not verified by this diagram.
endlegend
@enduml
